#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/fast_float.xml:87
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of Fast_float"
msgstr "Instalação do Fast_float"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/fast_float.xml:90
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>fast_float</application> by running the following "
"commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale <application>fast_float</application> executando os seguintes "
"comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/fast_float.xml:94
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"cmake -D CMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=/usr \\\n"
"      -D CMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release  \\\n"
"      -G Ninja ..\n"
"</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"cmake -D CMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=/usr \\\n"
"      -D CMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release  \\\n"
"      -G Ninja ..\n"
"</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/fast_float.xml:103
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr "Agora, como o(a) usante <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/fast_float.xml:106
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/fast_float.xml:109
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To test the results, issue: <command>cmake .. -D FASTFLOAT_TEST=ON "
"&amp;&amp; ninja &amp;&amp; ninja test</command>.  Note that the tests "
"download some test files and the external doctest test framework from the "
"Internet, and the doctest package would have been installed if the test "
"suite had run before <command>ninja install</command>, so don't run the test"
" suite before installation."
msgstr ""
"Para testar os resultados, emita: <command>cmake .. -D FASTFLOAT_TEST=ON "
"&amp;&amp; ninja &amp;&amp; ninja test</command>. Observe que os testes "
"baixam da Internet alguns arquivos de teste e a estrutura de teste externa "
"doctest, e o pacote doctest teria sido instalado se a suíte de teste tivesse"
" sido executada antes de <command>ninja install</command>, de modo que não "
"execute a suíte de teste antes da instalação."

